    "title": "Anthropic opens Singapore office and signs MOU with the Government of Singapore",
    "summary": "Today, we are expanding our Asia-Pacific operations by opening a new office in Singapore—our fifth in the region—and sig...",
    "full_content": "<article class=\"\"><div class=\"page-wrapper PostDetail-module-scss-module__UQuRMa__hero\"><div class=\"PostDetail-module-scss-module__UQuRMa__illustrationHeroWrapper\"><div class=\"Illustration-module-scss-module__WyGOtq__root Illustration-module-scss-module__WyGOtq__aspect-wide Illustration-module-scss-module__WyGOtq__padding-lg Illustration-module-scss-module__WyGOtq__radius-lg bg-olive\"><div class=\"Illustration-module-scss-module__WyGOtq__inner\"><img alt=\"Anthropic opens Singapore office and signs MOU with the Government of Singapore\" class=\"\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https://www-cdn.anthropic.com/images/4zrzovbb/website/5f455d24ea80569b34eb4347f06152d8a5508722-1000x1000.svg\" width=\"1000\" /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"page-wrapper\"><article><div class=\"\"><div class=\"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW__body\"><p class=\"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW__reading-column body-2 serif post-text\">Today, we are expanding our Asia-Pacific operations by opening a new office in Singapore—our fifth in the region—and signing a Memorandum of Understanding (MOU) with the Singapore Ministry of Digital Development and Information. Singapore is one of our most active markets anywhere in the world, and Claude is already powering Singaporean business and government services used by millions of people every day, like GovTech Singapore, Grab, and DBS. Our growing local team will ensure these organizations and many more stay on the frontier with safe, capable AI.</p><p class=\"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW__reading-column body-2 serif post-text\"></p><p class=\"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW__reading-column body-2 serif post-text\">“We’re committed to Singapore for the long term,” said Dale Finlay, General Manager of ASEAN at Anthropic. “Our customers here hold AI to an extremely high standard, esp…",
